<p>
  <%= link_to "Confirm your request to join #{@group_name}", join_request_confirmation_url(token: @token) %>.

  The link works once and expires in <%= distance_of_time_in_words(0, JoinRequest::EXPIRES_IN) %>.
  Once you confirm, the group still has to approve you before you see anything of it.
</p>

<p>
  If you did not ask to join <%= @group_name %>, ignore this message and the link expires unused.
</p>
